OL,3,GNEWSA'Our customers turned break-in
OL,4,Ainto record sales'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Closing the doors for the day I felt
OL,7,Fexhausted and loved, it felt like a
OL,8,Fwarm, nice day and everybody left with
OL,9,Fa smile on their face," Natalie
OL,10,FCapewell said after the busiest day at
OL,11,Fher cafe since it opened eight years
OL,12,Fago.
OL,14,FCustomers rallied round after The Two
OL,15,FMugs in Shirley, Solihull, had its door
OL,16,Fkicked in and an empty till stolen,
OL,17,Fleaving the owners of the independent
OL,18,Fbusiness feeling "demoralised".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
