OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Our customers turned break-in
OL,4,Ainto record sales'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter they posted the news on Facebook,
OL,7,Fcustomers piled into the cafe on Sunday
OL,8,Fto show their support, increasing sales
OL,9,Fby 20% with extra staff members brought
OL,10,Fin to help.
OL,12,FThe former IT manager said "all credit"
OL,13,Fwent to her staff, who worked without
OL,14,Fbreaks to cope with demand.
